<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-he-drosophila-ventral-furrow-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Conte et al. (2012), Martin et al. (2009) & He et al. (2014) Drosophila ventral furrow invagination biomechanics — Code-to-model traceability: 92/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The module docstring (L1-76) states all five governing laws with their Lean theorem names, each new section carries a header explaining what was asked, what was implemented and what is reduced (L612-626, L846-854), every new function docstring cites its equation and source, and the math KG loop file registers both new equations with lean_locus and code_locus ranges that match the current files. Deductions: the regime block does not state in code that its targets are the reference values being measured against (-4); the Stokes operator derivation is explained in a comment rather than referenced to a textbook equation number (-2); the GIF code (L1767-1842) does not mention the new mechanisms (-2)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2012-he-drosophila-ventral-furrow.py L332–L369: Regime targets are not annotated as the audited reference values <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/7e4f207/2012-he-drosophila-ventral-furrow.py#L332-L369>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-he-drosophila-ventral-furrow-code-traceability-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-he-drosophila-ventral-furrow-code-traceability-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-he-drosophila-ventral-furrow-code-traceability-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.2e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-he-drosophila-ventral-furrow-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Conte et al. (2012), Martin et al. (2009) & He et al. (2014) Drosophila ventral furrow invagination biomechanics — Model fidelity to source: 87/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Credited: exact incompressible wedge geometry and RK2 ratcheted-pulse ODE (L153-249), the new AP shell line equation with exact ellipsoid curvatures, simply supported poles and a verified second-order stencil (L627-719; uncoupled run recovers the 2D depth to 0.1% at 50% EL), the new variable-viscosity Stokes operator derived by taking the curl of div(sigma) = 0 with exact boundary-flux closure and an exact-solution check to 1e-12 (L855-1003), and 5 Lean theorems (0 sorrys) pinning Theorems 1-5. Deductions: the regime depth and cell height in the 2D ring are prescribed interpolants pinned to the reference values at the last step (L332-369, L443-445, L455-458) rather than solved from the viscous-vertex force balance, so the Conte (2012) decomposition is reproduced by construction (-7, newly exposed); the AP coupling is a 1D line + kinematic sweep, not a 3D FE shell, and ell_B / ell_N are free parameters (-3); the Stokes domain is a fixed rectangle with velocity BCs rather than a moving trapezoid with cortical stress BCs (-3)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2012-he-drosophila-ventral-furrow.py L332–L369: Regime block hard-codes target_ap_um / target_h_um / target_depth_um equal to the empirical reference values <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/7e4f207/2012-he-drosophila-ventral-furrow.py#L332-L369>",
        "2012-he-drosophila-ventral-furrow.py L443–L458: h_mean = target_h_um and depth_um = target_depth_um forced at the last step; depth is an interpolant of constr_frac and prog, not a mechanical solve <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/7e4f207/2012-he-drosophila-ventral-furrow.py#L443-L458>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-he-drosophila-ventral-furrow-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-he-drosophila-ventral-furrow-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-he-drosophila-ventral-furrow-model-fidelity-3>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-he-drosophila-ventral-furrow-model-fidelity-4> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.7e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-he-drosophila-ventral-furrow-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Conte et al. (2012), Martin et al. (2009) & He et al. (2014) Drosophila ventral furrow invagination biomechanics — Morphometric validation: 86/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` now returns 12 measurements (L1196-1416). New in Pass 3: D_3D(0.5 EL) = 39.92 um vs 41.0 ref (coupling ratio 0.974), furrow half-depth extent 0.590 EL vs ~0.65 ref, ell_N ablation ratio 0.534 (no empirical reference, stated as such), Stokes passive-tracer ratio 0.983 vs 1.0 (He 2014), and the exact-solution verification 8.1e-13 vs 0. Deductions: the 6-regime depth/height r = 1.0000 and RMSE = 0 (measurement 3) are circular because the regimes are pinned to the reference values (-8, newly exposed); the 0.65 EL and ~1.0 tracer references are approximate literature statements rather than digitised values (-4); no error bars or sensitivity of the new measurements to ell_B / nucleus geometry (-2)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2012-he-drosophila-ventral-furrow.py L1249–L1264: 6-regime Pearson r measurement is computed against the same reference values the regimes are pinned to <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/7e4f207/2012-he-drosophila-ventral-furrow.py#L1249-L1264>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-he-drosophila-ventral-furrow-measurement-3d-shell-coupled-wt-furrow-depth-at-50-egg-length-d-3d-0-5-el>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-he-drosophila-ventral-furrow-measurement-6-regime-invagination-depth-pearson-correlation-r>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-he-drosophila-ventral-furrow-measurement-apical-constriction-only-shallow-groove-depth-d-ap-only>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-he-drosophila-ventral-furrow-measurement-germband-extension-tension-ablation-ratio-d-3d-ell-n-150-um-d-3d-ell-n-0>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-he-drosophila-ventral-furrow-measurement-specimen-4-stage-invagination-trajectory-correlation-r>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-he-drosophila-ventral-furrow-measurement-specimen-stage-4-invaginated-dv-ml-aspect-ratio>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-he-drosophila-ventral-furrow-measurement-stokes-resolved-nucleus-cytoplasm-basal-velocity-ratio-passive-tracer>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-he-drosophila-ventral-furrow-measurement-stokes-solver-verification-affine-lengthening-exact-solution-l2-error>,
