    dct:description "`--self-test` passes in ~11 s with 6 check blocks (SHA-256 locks for 4 files, Theorems 1-5 numerics, 6-regime hierarchy, bitwise determinism of the ring and of the Stokes solve, specimen CV, 12 measurements); the default render (PNG + 24-frame GIF) takes ~5 s; the GIF regenerates byte-identically to the v2 artifact (SHA-256 5988ec19...); the only RNG is seeded and unused. Deductions: no requirements lock file for this slot (-3); the PNG byte-identity across runs is not asserted in the self-test (-2); MPLCONFIGDIR must be writable, which is not documented (-2)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-repro-package> ;
