    dct:description "Four SHA-256-pinned dataset files (the new `ap_shell_stokes_reference.json` is pinned at L102-116 and verified at runtime), bib extended with Sweeton 1991, Leptin & Grunewald 1990, Lye 2015, and the dataset README documents the two new laws and the Pass 3 caveats. Deductions: the three new DOIs could not be re-verified offline and are flagged as such (-4); the mesoderm extent (0.15-0.80 EL), reference furrow span (0.65 EL) and GBE onset are approximate, un-digitised literature values (-4); ell_B and the WT ell_N ramp have no source at all and are declared model assumptions (-2)." ;
